#N canvas 0 0 640 460 10;
#X text 60 30 modseq — tracker module sequencer (XM / MOD);
#X text 60 52 owns the SONG: tempo + rows + note timing + the pattern;
#X text 60 70 effects — arpeggio / slides / portamento / vibrato /;
#X text 60 88 offset / retrig / cut+delay. No audio of its own — feed;
#X text 60 106 [instr] voices or synths or whatever;
#X text 60 140 events (left outlet — per channel):;
#X text 90 158 note <ch> <instr> <midi> <gain>;
#X text 90 176 off <ch> <instr> / vol <ch> <instr> <gain>;
#X text 90 194 pitch <ch> <instr> <semis> / pos <ch> <instr> <0..1>;
#X text 60 226 meta (middle outlet):;
#X text 90 244 ins <idx> <nsmp> <fadeout> <envon> <npts> <sus> <la> <lb>;
#X text 90 262 smp <instr> <idx> <base> <loop> <ls> <le> <frames>;
#X text 90 280 smpfile <instr> <idx> <abspath> — emitted by dump;
#X text 90 298 loaded <ninstr> <nch> <orders> / row / tempo / end bang;
#X text 60 330 right outlet: bang once per tick — wire into [instr];
#X text 60 364 messages: open <file> / start / stop / play 1|0;
#X text 60 382 goto <order> / loop 0|1 / dump / info;
#X obj 480 60 modseq;
